{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Resentment</strong> is a psychological horror game that follows Lisa Parker through a traumatic event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As she is questioned by local police authorities, you will relive the events of that fateful evening as Lisa explains what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lisa Parker is an international student living in Japan during the early 2000s. Working a part-time job at the SpinFuel Gas Station, her daily routine revolves around the mundane tasks of scanning products, restocking shelves, and maintaining the store. However, her quiet life begins to unravel when she starts noticing a mysterious man who seems to be watching her and the store from afar\u2014over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-Driven Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Customer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two Official Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets\u2026?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two Nights: The game takes place over two nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with trashcans to retrieve the trashbag.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 40 - 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544970?t=1741097198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544970/665ea35d407a40b683c4776d63f15ad147c02a95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741097198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544970/4a91efbb7cd3e1f0499deeb965162b21ff68083d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741097198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544970/4a91efbb7cd3e1f0499deeb965162b21ff68083d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741097198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Resentment</strong> is a psychological horror game that follows Lisa Parker through a traumatic event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As she is questioned by local police authorities, you will relive the events of that fateful evening as Lisa explains what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lisa Parker is an international student living in Japan during the early 2000s. Working a part-time job at the SpinFuel Gas Station, her daily routine revolves around the mundane tasks of scanning products, restocking shelves, and maintaining the store. However, her quiet life begins to unravel when she starts noticing a mysterious man who seems to be watching her and the store from afar\u2014over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-Driven Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Customer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two Official Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets\u2026?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two Nights: The game takes place over two nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with trashcans to retrieve the trashbag.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> 40 - 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>","developers":["Silent Signal Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544970/0dfb748fbb864d8706b2260eb6b82bc1ffc98f4c/header.jpg?t=1741097198","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<